(7541329, 1206940, 31240, '<td valign="top">Thanks all!  This is my first!   It is a stack of 37 images taken with the Helicon FB Tube.  It is an extension tube that is programmed with your phone to take a picture and then zoom in by a certain number of steps before the next picture.  You start at the nearest point, and using Live View, stop at the farthest.  Then Helicon Focus handles the stacking.  Lightroom to adjust levels, etc.</td>', 'Thanks all!  This is my first!   It is a stack of 37 images taken with the Helicon FB Tube.  It is an extension tube that is programmed with your phone to take a picture and then zoom in by a certain number of steps before the next picture.  You start at the nearest point, and using Live View, stop at the farthest.  Then Helicon Focus handles the stacking.  Lightroom to adjust levels, etc.', '2017-10-29 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
