(7541562, 1206949, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SaraR:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh wow, this is perfect.  Countryfile calendar material, me thinks. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you SaraR - I did enter that competition a couple of years ago but didn''t get a look in. I will certainly enter this one next year:)</td>', 'Originally posted by SaraR: Oh wow, this is perfect.  Countryfile calendar material, me thinks.   Thank you SaraR - I did enter that competition a couple of years ago but didn''t get a look in. I will certainly enter this one next year:)', '2017-10-30 06:00:12.000000', NULL, 0),
