(7541729, 1206589, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>A great image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>A lovely image Ronnie, you have every right to be pleased with the lens performance. I like the composition with the bird to the left looking in, it works well. What I am not so keen on is the centre background, especially in view of the challenge theme, it rather dominates but the clump of grass on the right does save the day Anyway, it was rightly appreciated here which is what matters well done with your high placing.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club A great image that contributes to the challenge well A lovely image Ronnie, you have every right to be pleased with the lens performance. I like the composition with the bird to the left looking in, it works well. What I am not so keen on is the centre background, especially in view of the challenge theme, it rather dominates but the clump of grass on the right does save the day Anyway, it was rightly appreciated here which is what matters well done with your high placing.', '2017-10-31 09:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597604, 1206589, 117099, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2018-09-25 12:20:10.000000', NULL, 0);
